{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-112572-r4541041","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Peach Pie","sourcePageId":112572,"sourceRevision":"4541041","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-04T22:09:25Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Peach%20Pie&oldid=4541041","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:20:13.786Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes for pies and tarts","Category:Recipes using almond extract","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using peach","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Southern U.S. recipes","Category:Vegetarian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"c3445342e26d244b5c553531c32c36e4a72a32a7a76169213e0688e2e7162ab1","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Pie and tart recipes|yield=2 pies|time=2–3 hours|difficulty=3\n| Image = [[Image:Peach pie (1469524201).jpg|300px]]\n}}\n__NOTOC__\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Southern cuisine|Southern U.S. cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Vegetarian cuisine|Vegetarian Cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Holiday Recipes|Holiday Recipes]] | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n===Crust===\nFor 1–2 crusts:\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1¾ cups [[Cookbook:Shortening|shortening]]\n* ½ cup ice [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n\n===Pie===\n* 5 [[Cookbook:Pound|pounds]] [[Cookbook:Peach|peaches]]\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* ¼ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Almond|almond extract]]\n* 2 tablespoons flour\n* ½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* ¼ teaspoon salt\n* 4 Tablespoons [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n===Crust===\n# Mix flour, sugar, and salt together.\n# Add shortening and mix until crumbly.\n# [[Cookbook:Beat|Beat]] together ice water, vinegar, and egg and cut into flour mix.\n# Divide into 4 balls.\n# Wrap and refrigerate for ½ hour before [[Cookbook:Dough#Rolling|rolling out]].\n# Line a [[Cookbook:Pie and Tart Pans|pie dish]] with the rolled-out crust, and crimp the edges.\n\n===Pie===\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|450°F]].\n# Peel and [[Cookbook:Slicing|slice]] peaches.\n# Transfer to a bowl and mix in lemon juice and almond extract.\n# In a separate bowl, mix dry ingredients, and add to peach mixture.\n# Pour into crust and dot with butter.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 450°F for 15 minutes, then 350°F for 35–40 minutes.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:Southern U.S. recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pies and tarts]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peach]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond extract]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Peach Pie","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"4 cups flour","sourceText":"4 cups flour","amountText":"4 cups flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tablespoon sugar","sourceText":"1 tablespoon sugar","amountText":"1 tablespoon sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 teaspoons salt","sourceText":"2 teaspoons salt","amountText":"2 teaspoons salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1¾ cups shortening","sourceText":"1¾ cups shortening","amountText":"1¾ cups shortening","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ cup ice water","sourceText":"½ cup ice water","amountText":"½ cup ice water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 teaspoon vinegar","sourceText":"1 teaspoon vinegar","amountText":"1 teaspoon vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 egg","sourceText":"1 egg","amountText":"1 egg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"5 pounds peaches","sourceText":"5 pounds peaches","amountText":"5 pounds peaches","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"1 teaspoon lemon juice","sourceText":"1 teaspoon lemon juice","amountText":"1 teaspoon lemon juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"¼ teaspoon almond extract","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon almond extract","amountText":"¼ teaspoon almond extract","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","n